// Package round2 holds the frozen inputs of the round-2 comparison: the
// four cases product.md names, their hidden answers and the population
// behind the pool (all generated by seed.GenerateRound2), the arm-2 PayPal
// records and extraction input, the arm prompt template, the reference
// reasoner the fairness check runs, and the round-2 grader.
//
// Nothing here talks to a model. Every check in this package runs offline:
// no key, no network, no spend. The freeze manifest is FROZEN.md, and
// bench/round2/freeze_check.sh verifies its hashes from tools/check.sh.
//
// Arms, as product.md numbers them: 1 no memory, 2 PayPal history (exactly
// what the Agent Toolkit returns, per T10.1), 3 Memento shopper-only (the
// shopper's own evidence, labels and corrections, no pool), 4 Memento full
// (the same plus the pool and the precedence rule).
package round2
